---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import MediaThumb from '../components/MediaThumb.astro';
// Character page: portrait + full in-character bio. The portrait asset
// (public/don-biggly-portrait.webp) is owner-supplied; a missing/failed file
// degrades to a neutral placeholder (same pattern as the products grid).
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Who the Hell Is Don Biggly? — Booze on Hormuz™"
  description="An introduction to Don Biggly, reluctantly provided by his legal team."
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="An introduction" title="Who the Hell Is Don Biggly?" />

  <section class="px-6 pb-28 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <figure class="card-marble border border-line rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg max-w-[280px] mx-auto mb-10">
      <MediaThumb src="/don-biggly-portrait.webp" alt="Don Biggly, photographed from behind. He approved it without turning around." aspect="aspect-[4/5]" fit="contain" fallback="Portrait pending counsel" sizes="280px" />
      <figcaption class="font-body text-xs text-ink-soft/70 text-center p-2 italic">
        Official portrait. Likeness withheld on advice of counsel.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="font-body text-lg text-ink-soft space-y-5">
      <p>
        By every metric his own team was willing to sign, Don Biggly is the most decorated
        hospitality visionary ever to operate within nautical miles of an active geopolitical
        incident. Many people say this. The people who say it are paid, but they say it.
      </p>
      <p>
        He holds honorary credentials from institutions that have asked not to be named, and
        several awards he commissioned, presented to himself, and accepted with visible emotion.
        The &ldquo;Admiral&rdquo; is honorary. He conferred it. The uniform is real, which his
        tailor describes as &ldquo;the only verifiable part.&rdquo;
      </p>
      <p>
        The empire began, as all great empires do, with a waterfront nobody else wanted and a
        disclaimer nobody else would read. Today Booze on Hormuz spans an Exclusion Zone of
        unrivaled amenities &mdash; a shrimp tower visible from two countries, financing available
        against the news cycle, and a concierge desk that doubles, when required, as a legal
        department.
      </p>
      <p>
        He has never been charged with anything that stuck, a record his counsel characterizes
        as &ldquo;basically an acquittal.&rdquo; His philosophy is simple, gold-bound, and printed
        on a card he will hand you whether or not you ask: be together, be inspired, be briefed by
        counsel.
      </p>
      <p>
        A fuller biography is being prepared by people who are not under oath. It will be
        tremendous. It will also be reviewed, redacted, and &mdash; where legally advisable
        &mdash; denied.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
